  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Network for EaP 2016-2023 - The Swedish Network for EaP 2016-2019</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Swedish Network for EaP 2016-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project goal: Contribute to democracy building and fullfilled human rights in accordance with the principles of the Eastern partnership agreements.

Project objective: Well-established and effective cooperation between Swedish and local EaP actors resulting in productive and long-term partnership and capacity building as well as the incorporation of civil society perspectives in advocacy activities, public awareness raising and democratic decision-making.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till den svenska plattformens verksamhet med l&#xe4;nderna inom &#xd6;stliga partnerskapet genom fortsatt st&#xf6;d till ForumCiv (tidigare Forum Syd). St&#xf6;det t&#xe4;cker Armenien, Azerbajdzjan, Belarus, Georgien, Moldavien och Ukraina. Plattformen syftar till att bidra till en demokratisk utveckling inom l&#xe4;nderna genom &#xf6;kat samarbete mellan svenska CSO och genom st&#xe4;rkt samarbete med CSO fr&#xe5;n l&#xe4;nderna inom &#xd6;stliga partnerskapet. Projektet ska bidra till m&#xe5;let att fr&#xe4;mja ett starkare och mer pluralistiskt  samh&#xe4;lle i dessa l&#xe4;nder. Det syftar vidare till att st&#xf6;dja ett civilt samh&#xe4;lle som g&#xf6;r det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nniskor att f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndra sina liv och samh&#xe4;llen p&#xe5; lokal, regional , nationell och global niv&#xe5;. Slutligen ska projektet bidra till &#xf6;kade kontakter och &#xf6;kat samarbete mellan det civila samh&#xe4;llet i l&#xe4;nderna inom &#xd6;stliga partnerskapet och EU:s medlemsl&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Swedish Platform&apos;s activities with the Eastern Partnership countries through continued support to ForumCiv (formerly Forum Syd). The support covers Armenia, Azerbaijan, Belarus, Georgia, Moldova and Ukraine. The platform aims to contribute to democratic development within the countries through increased cooperation between Swedish CSOs and through strengthened cooperation with CSOs from the Eastern Partnership countries. The project will contribute to the goal of promoting a stronger and more pluralistic society in these countries. It further aims to support a civil society that enables people to transform their lives and communities at local, regional, national and global levels. Finally, the project will contribute to increased contacts and cooperation between civil society in the Eastern Partnership countries and the EU member states.</narrative>
  </description>
